{"slug":"maximum-average-subarray-i","title":"Maximum Average Subarray I","level":"Easy","summary":"Find the contiguous subarray of length k with the largest average and return that average.","method":"findMaxAverage","params":[["int[]","nums"],["int","k"]],"returns":"double","tests":[{"in":["[1,12,-5,-6,50,3]","4"],"out":"12.75"},{"in":["[5]","1"],"out":"5.0"},{"in":["[-1,-2,-3]","2"],"out":"-1.5"},{"in":["[0,4,0,3,2]","1"],"out":"4.0"},{"in":["[3,3,4,3,0]","3"],"out":"3.3333333333333335"},{"in":["[6512,1027,1,10000,-3402,-2700,2445,-8668,-2974,8249,10000]","1"],"out":"10000.0","g":1},{"in":["[-1133]","1"],"out":"-1133.0","g":1},{"in":["[-1]","1"],"out":"-1.0","g":1},{"in":["[10000,-1023,6238]","3"],"out":"5071.666666666667","g":1},{"in":["[-5567,-5568]","2"],"out":"-5567.5","g":1},{"in":["[8890,-8618,-3225,-1090,5740,-4617,10000,10000,-9336,1,7051,-10000]","11"],"out":"1345.090909090909","g":1},{"in":["[6718,6719]","2"],"out":"6718.5","g":1},{"in":["[10000,-289,-289,-289,10000]","1"],"out":"10000.0","g":1},{"in":["[-846]","1"],"out":"-846.0","g":1},{"in":["[10000,-1,-10000,-8328,6207,-8263,10000,-3100,1]","1"],"out":"10000.0","g":1},{"in":["[2073,2073,2071,2070,2071,2070,2073,2073]","1"],"out":"2073.0","g":1},{"in":["[7236,1397,7236,1397,7236,7236,1397,1397,1397,1397,1397,1397,1397,7236,1397,1397,7236,7236,1397,1397,1397,1397]","18"],"out":"3667.722222222222","g":1},{"in":["[8737,8736,8738,8737,8737,8737,8736,8737]","1"],"out":"8738.0","g":1},{"in":["[3819,3819,-7428,-7428,3819,-7428,3819,3819,-7428,3819,-7428,3819,-7428]","8"],"out":"-398.625","g":1},{"in":["[9914,9913,9913,9913,9913,9912,9911]","1"],"out":"9914.0","g":1},{"in":["[-5188,2199]","1"],"out":"2199.0","g":1},{"in":["[8720,8723,8721,8718,8720]","1"],"out":"8723.0","g":1},{"in":["[10000,9354,-10000,7059]","4"],"out":"4103.25","g":1},{"in":["[352,3420,3420,3420]","3"],"out":"3420.0","g":1},{"in":["[2539,2538,2537,2538,2538,2538,2540,2537]","8"],"out":"2538.125","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-7022,4671,7519]","4"],"out":"-1208.0","g":1},{"in":["[4347]","1"],"out":"4347.0","g":1},{"in":["[6706,6706,6706,6707,6706,6706,6706,6705]","6"],"out":"6706.166666666667","g":1},{"in":["[-2645,-2645,-2632,-2632,-2632]","4"],"out":"-2635.25","g":1},{"in":["[-9598]","1"],"out":"-9598.0","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-8961,-8748,-4058,-3871,-1723,-1070,1,529,2083]","10"],"out":"-3581.8","g":1},{"in":["[-9098,-1257,-9098,-9098,-1257,-1257,-1257,-9098]","1"],"out":"-1257.0","g":1},{"in":["[-10000]","1"],"out":"-10000.0","g":1},{"in":["[1,6253,-8535,-9277]","1"],"out":"6253.0","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000]","2"],"out":"-10000.0","g":1},{"in":["[-9491]","1"],"out":"-9491.0","g":1},{"in":["[-1742,1675,10000,-4631,10000,-10000]","4"],"out":"4261.0","g":1},{"in":["[4743,4739]","1"],"out":"4743.0","g":1},{"in":["[8238,8238,8238,8237,8237,8237,8236,8236,8236,8236,8236,8236,8235,8235,8235,8234,8234,8234]","14"],"out":"8236.5","g":1},{"in":["[4146,1,1,4146,4146,4146,1,4146,4146,4146,4146,4146,1,1,4146,4146,4146,4146,4146,1,1,4146,1,1,4146]","1"],"out":"4146.0","g":1},{"in":["[-3765,-3765,-10000,-3765,-3765,-3765]","1"],"out":"-3765.0","g":1},{"in":["[3214,-10000,-2553,6229,3785,-10000,-3480]","1"],"out":"6229.0","g":1},{"in":["[36]","1"],"out":"36.0","g":1},{"in":["[-514]","1"],"out":"-514.0","g":1},{"in":["[5262,5263,5263]","2"],"out":"5263.0","g":1},{"in":[],"out":"\"#8:9fc02221b985d90d\"","perf":{"label":"n = 100,000, k = 50,000","gen":"int[] a0 = BCB.ints(100000, -10000, 10000); int a1 = 50000;"},"refMs":1}],"lesson":"sliding-window","statement":"Among all contiguous subarrays of `nums` that have exactly `k` elements, find the one with the largest average and return that average.\n\nAnswers within `1e-5` of the exact value are accepted.\n\nSlide a window of exactly `k` elements across the array, adding the element that enters and subtracting the one that leaves, and keep the largest sum.","constraints":["n == nums.length","1 <= n <= 1e5","1 <= k <= n","-1e4 <= nums[i] <= 1e4"],"hints":["All windows have the same length k, so the window with the largest sum also has the largest average.","Compute the sum of the first k values, then slide: add the value entering on the right and subtract the one leaving on the left.","Track the best sum while sliding and divide by k once at the end. Use a double (or long) for the division."],"explain":"The windows of 4 elements sum to 2, 51 and 42. The best is `[12,-5,-6,50]` with sum 51, and 51 / 4 = 12.75."},
