t":"true","g":1},{"in":["[901690192,901690196,901690195,901690197,901690191,901690196,901690192,901690191,901690196]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[1,-934373880,-934373880,-934373880,-934373880,1,-934373880,-934373880,1]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[902087857,902087857,902087857]","3"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[1000000000,-81557123,331147939,-455817676,1000000000,-1000000000,-147015228,697647005,947829365]","100000"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-127924798,-127924798,-127924798,-1000000000,-1000000000]","100000"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-864607998,945234996]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[-901744063,-901744065,-901744069]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[470908364,81049449,81049449]","100000"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-177564651,-177564651,-177564651,-653480153,-653480153,-653480153,-653480153,-653480153,-653480153]","1"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[1000000000,-1000000000,255802074,1,30140832,1000000000,1,-966827045,-1000000000,-488318531,592657007]","7"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-1000000000]","100000"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[1,972332102,51773989,-300536672,30389809]","1"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[100786956,100786956,476737760,100786956,100786956,476737760,100786956]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[-875765077]","1"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[53847755]","100000"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[-48562876,-48562876,-48562876,-48562876,-48562875,-48562874,-48562872,-48562871,-48562871,-48562870]","100000"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[535372082]","1"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[-206617129]","1"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[-318375166,-318375167,-318375168,-318375167,-318375173,-318375165,-318375169,-318375172,-318375168,-318375170,-318375167,-318375172,-318375165,-318375167,-318375168,-318375169,-318375169,-318375172,-318375168,-318375167,-318375167,-318375167]","22"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[720712520,720712523,720712520,720712522,720712520,720712520,720712522,720712520,720712520]","9"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[673047933,673047935,673047932,673047935,673047933,673047933,673047933]","6"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[357545444,357545444,357545445,357545446,357545448,357545445,357545449,357545449,357545451,357545446,357545448,357545451,357545444,357545451]","14"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-1000000000,-463437735,881612409,120920184,-1000000000,-908567762,-390744298,19108082,578339031,-724527327,-134755247,617022909,-1000000000]","13"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[1000000000,1000000000,1000000000,1000000000,1000000000,1000000000,977414771,855100172,790046538,766923062,61669142,0,-184536195,-339582519,-585953181,-642303315,-984935329,-1000000000,-1000000000]","19"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[-53687803,-865426920,-53687803]","100000"],"out":"true","g":1},{"in":["[161875285,1000000000]","2"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[1000000000]","1"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":["[1000000000,186872874]","0"],"out":"false","g":1},{"in":[],"out":"\"#5:b5fae2c14238b978\"","perf":{"label":"n = 100,000, k = 100,000","gen":"int[] a0 = BCB.distinct(100000, -1000000000, 1000000000); int a1 = 100000;"},"refMs":8}],"lesson":"sliding-window","statement":"Return `true` if there are two **different** indices `i` and `j` with `nums[i] == nums[j]` and `|i − j| <= k`. Otherwise return `false`.\n\nFor example `[1,2,3,1,2,3]` with k = 2 is `false`: every repeated value is exactly 3 positions after its first copy.","constraints":["1 <= nums.length <= 1e5","-1e9 <= nums[i] <= 1e9","0 <= k <= 1e5"],"hints":["Checking the next k elements after every position is O(n · k), up to 10¹⁰ steps.","You only ever care about the last k values you have seen. That is a window that slides one step at a time.","Keep the window's values in a HashSet. Before adding nums[i], if it is already there you found a pair; after adding, remove nums[i − k] once the set holds more than k values. (A map from value to last index works too.)"],"explain":"The value 1 sits at indices 0 and 3, which are 3 apart, and k = 3 allows that distance, so the answer is `true`."},
{"slug":"find-k-closest-elements","title":"Find K Closest Elements","level":"Medium","summary":"arr is sorted. Return the k values closest to x, sorted ascending. On a tie in distance, the smaller value counts as closer.","method":"findClosestElements","params":[["int[]","arr"],["int","k"],["int","x"]],"returns":"List<Integer>","tests":[{"in":["[1,2,3,4,5]","4","3"],"out":"[1,2,3,4]"},{"in":["[1,1,2,3,4,5]","4","-1"],"out":"[1,1,2,3]"},{"in":["[1,2,3,4,5]","4","9"],"out":"[2,3,4,5]"},{"in":["[1]","1","1"],"out":"[1]"},{"in":["[0,0,1,2,3,3,4,7,7,8]","3","5"],"out":"[3,3,4]"},{"in":["[1,3]","1","2"],"out":"[1]"},{"in":["[1,1,1,10,10,10]","1","9"],"out":"[10]"},{"in":["[6283]","1","-9414"],"out":"[6283]","g":1},{"in":["[-8935]","1","-8934"],"out":"[-8935]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-6807,-2087,-1,1,1326,3209,5496,10000]","1","-6807"],"out":"[-6807]","g":1},{"in":["[-9766,2569,10000]","1","2569"],"out":"[2569]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-9126,-5678,-5175,-4569,-2286,-2139,-1857,-859,-1,-1,-1,154,2814,4083,4449,5441,7660,8276,9754,10000,10000,10000,10000]","22","3169"],"out":"[-5678,-5175,-4569,-2286,-2139,-1857,-859,-1,-1,-1,154,2814,4083,4449,5441,7660,8276,9754,10000,10000,10000,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-8943,-8942,-8942]","3","-8942"],"out":"[-8943,-8942,-8942]","g":1},{"in":["[-1190,-1190,-1190,-1189,-1189,-1188,-1188,-1188]","8","390"],"out":"[-1190,-1190,-1190,-1189,-1189,-1188,-1188,-1188]","g":1},{"in":["[10000,10000]","2","-4852"],"out":"[10000,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-9014,1774,6105,8218,10000]","2","10000"],"out":"[8218,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[2229]","1","-10000"],"out":"[2229]","g":1},{"in":["[-1]","1","0"],"out":"[-1]","g":1},{"in":["[1904]","1","2103"],"out":"[1904]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,1782,6693,10000,10000]","1","10000"],"out":"[10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-9776,-6632,-6105,-4753,-4152,4019,5765,7057,8105,8563,10000,10000,10000]","1","-10000"],"out":"[-10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-599,-599]","4","-10000"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-599,-599]","g":1},{"in":["[-7619,-7618,-7613,-7612]","4","-7611"],"out":"[-7619,-7618,-7613,-7612]","g":1},{"in":["[-9228,-9227]","2","-2908"],"out":"[-9228,-9227]","g":1},{"in":["[-11,-11,-10,-9,-9,-9,-9,-9,-8,-8,-8,-7,-7,-7,-7,-6,-6,-6,-5,-5,-5,-4,-4,-4,-4]","1","-10000"],"out":"[-11]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-9801,-366,764,9000]","1","8134"],"out":"[9000]","g":1},{"in":["[-5233]","1","-10000"],"out":"[-5233]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,1076,1516,6599,7979]","5","-2995"],"out":"[-10000,1076,1516,6599,7979]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-9333,-8983,-6623,-5024,-66,-1,0,1,2119,4253]","10","-798"],"out":"[-9333,-8983,-6623,-5024,-66,-1,0,1,2119,4253]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-7906,-5330,-4344,-1645,2557,9607,10000,10000]","10","10000"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-7906,-5330,-4344,-1645,2557,9607,10000,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-4015]","1","-10000"],"out":"[-4015]","g":1},{"in":["[-3307,-3307,-3307,-3306,-3304,-3304,-3302]","6","-3304"],"out":"[-3307,-3307,-3306,-3304,-3304,-3302]","g":1},{"in":["[-428]","1","-427"],"out":"[-428]","g":1},{"in":["[8395,8397,8398,8399,8400,8400,8400,8400,8401]","1","-10000"],"out":"[8395]","g":1},{"in":["[-3997,10000]","2","10000"],"out":"[-3997,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[241]","1","241"],"out":"[241]","g":1},{"in":["[-1051,-1050,-1050,-1049]","2","-1049"],"out":"[-1050,-1049]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-9460,-7119,-6054,0,7623]","7","-10000"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-9460,-7119,-6054,0,7623]","g":1},{"in":["[-8421,-8421,-8420,-8416]","1","10000"],"out":"[-8416]","g":1},{"in":["[-5356]","1","7878"],"out":"[-5356]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-10000,-8956,-6695,8784]","6","8785"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-10000,-8956,-6695,8784]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-3000,-2149,-1924,-800,4672,5915,9929,10000]","10","-10000"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-3000,-2149,-1924,-800,4672,5915,9929,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000,-8225,-6792,-5123,-3338,0,0,2541,4984,9471,10000,10000,10000]","16","9471"],"out":"[-10000,-10000,-10000,-10000,-8225,-6792,-5123,-3338,0,0,2541,4984,9471,10000,10000,10000]","g":1},{"in":["[4368,4368,4368,4368,4368,4368,4368,4368,6787,6787,6787,6787]","4","4368"],"out":"[4368,4368,4368,4368]","g":1},{"in":["[-4568,1]","1","1"],"out":"[1]","g":1},{"in":["[-2733,-2731]","1","-2731"],"out":"[-2731]","g":1},{"in":["[-6566,-6566,-6565,-6565,-6565,-6565,-6564,-6564]","7","-6565"],"out":"[-6566,-6566,-6565,-6565,-6565,-6565,-6564]","g":1}],"lesson":"sliding-window","statement":"`arr` is sorted in ascending order. Return the `k` values of `arr` closest to `x`, also sorted in ascending order.\n\nValue `a` is closer to `x` than value `b` if `|a − x| < |b − x|`, or if the distances are equal and `a < b`.","constraints":["1 <= k <= arr.length","1 <= arr.length <= 1e4","`arr` is sorted in ascending order","-1e4 <= arr[i], x <= 1e4"],"hints":["Because arr is sorted, the answer is always a contiguous block of k values. You only need to find where it starts.","Two pointers: start with the whole array and repeatedly drop whichever end is farther from x (dropping the right end on a tie) until k values remain. That is O(n).","Binary search the start index s in [0, n − k]. Compare x − arr[mid] with arr[mid + k] − x: if the left value is farther, the window should start later. That is O(log(n − k) + k)."],"explain":"Distances from x = 3 are 2, 1, 0, 1, 2. The four smallest are 0, 1, 1 and one of the 2s; on that tie 1 beats 5 because it is smaller, so the answer is `[1,2,3,4]`."}
